  "title": "The Exact Ternary Value ASP(6,4,3)=12",
  "batch_label": "84",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "disproved",
  "scope": "No rank-six matrix G in F_3^(6 x 11) has the four-all-symbol PIR property: for every such G, at least one column fails to have four pairwise-disjoint recovery sets. Consequently ASP(6,4,3)=12, using the frozen source bound 11 <= ASP(6,4,3) <= 12.",
